# Phoenix Fleet Airship: "As long as you control eight or more permanents named Phoenix Fleet Airship, this Vehicle is an artifact creature."
# Bot1 sacrifices a permanent in each of its first three turns (Black Lotus, then a Lotus Petal each time), and every Airship it has then
# makes a copy at the end step: 1 -> 2 -> 4 -> 8. With four it is only a Vehicle; the turn it reaches eight each Airship (the original
# and the tokens) is an artifact creature, and still a Vehicle: it is a creature without being crewed.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Black Lotus
Phoenix Fleet Airship
Lotus Petal
Lotus Petal
Swamp x14
Swamp x5

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Phoenix Fleet Airship.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Lotus Petal.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Lotus Petal.Activate(Color: Black)
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 5
? Bot1.Battlefield.Phoenix Fleet Airship#1.Types = Artifact
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Lotus Petal.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Lotus Petal.Activate(Color: Black)
[T6 Bot2.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 9
Bot1.Battlefield.Phoenix Fleet Airship#1.Types = Artifact; Creature
Bot1.Battlefield.Phoenix Fleet Airship#8.Types = Artifact; Creature
Bot1.Battlefield.Phoenix Fleet Airship#8.Power = 4
